## Runtime DB (Supabase pooled/session URL for API traffic)
## Tune for backend concurrency; avoid connection_limit=1 in production.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<PROJECT_REF>:<PASSWORD>@aws-<REGION>.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres?pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=5&pool_timeout=30"

## Direct DB (preferred for migrations/introspection when network supports direct host)
## Use this for Prisma directUrl / migration tooling.
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres:<PASSWORD>@db.<PROJECT_REF>.supabase.co:5432/postgres"

## Supabase auth / storage
SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL="https://<PROJECT_REF>.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="<SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY>"
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET="<SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET>"

## CORS (comma-separated)
WEB_APP_URLS="http://localhost:3000,https://opsflow-erp-web.onrender.com"
